<!-- ═══════ SECTION 6 — SAFETY ENGINEERING ═══════ -->
<section class="sc-eng sc-eng-sec sc-eng-sec--dark">
  <div class="sc-eng-sec__inner">
    <div class="sc-eng-sec__header">
      <span class="sc-eng-sec__num">05</span>
      <span class="sc-eng-sec__line"></span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="sc-eng-sec__title">Safety Engineering</h2>
    <p class="sc-eng-sec__lead">Safety is not a feature list. It is a design principle.</p>

    <div class="sc-eng-safety">
      <div class="sc-eng-safety-item">
        <span class="sc-eng-safety-item__num">&lt;8 ms</span>
        <div class="sc-eng-safety-item__name">Instant Unload</div>
        <p class="sc-eng-safety-item__text">The digital weight system can drop resistance to zero in under 8 milliseconds. If you lose control mid-rep, one tap on the remote and the weight is gone. No barbell dropping. No spotter needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-eng-safety-item">
        <span class="sc-eng-safety-item__num">0 J</span>
        <div class="sc-eng-safety-item__name">No Momentum Transfer</div>
        <p class="sc-eng-safety-item__text">Unlike free weights, the digital resistance engine does not store kinetic energy. There is no barbell to drop, no cable to snap, no stack to crash. The resistance exists only when you are actively engaging it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-eng-safety-item">
        <span class="sc-eng-safety-item__num">67 kg</span>
        <div class="sc-eng-safety-item__name">Low Centre of Gravity</div>
        <p class="sc-eng-safety-item__text">The base sits flat on the floor with a wide stance. The machine does not tip, rock, or shift during use, even at maximum resistance with aggressive movement patterns.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-eng-safety-item">
        <span class="sc-eng-safety-item__num">&lt;25 dB</span>
        <div class="sc-eng-safety-item__name">Noiseless Operation</div>
        <p class="sc-eng-safety-item__text">Under 25 dB at full load. Not just quiet for a fitness machine &mdash; quiet by any standard. Protects your hearing, your relationships with housemates and neighbours, and your ability to train at any hour.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 3rem; padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(212,206,198,0.12);">
      <div class="sc-eng-safety-item__name" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Child-Safe Design</div>
      <p class="sc-eng-safety-item__text" style="max-width: 720px;">When stored upright, the machine presents no exposed moving parts. The robotic arms retract into the body. The resistance system is inactive when not in use.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════ SECTION 7 — QUALITY ASSURANCE ═══════ -->
<section class="sc-eng sc-eng-sec sc-eng-sec--alt">
  <div class="sc-eng-sec__inner">
    <div class="sc-eng-sec__header">
      <span class="sc-eng-sec__num">06</span>
      <span class="sc-eng-sec__line"></span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="sc-eng-sec__title">Quality Assurance</h2>
    <p class="sc-eng-sec__lead">Every Sensol machine goes through a multi-stage quality process before it ships.</p>

    <div class="sc-eng-qa-steps">
      <div class="sc-eng-qa-step">
        <span class="sc-eng-qa-step__num">Stage 01</span>
        <div class="sc-eng-qa-step__name">Component Testing</div>
        <p class="sc-eng-qa-step__text">Each motor, joint, and electronic component is tested individually before assembly. Motors are run through load cycles. Joints are tested for play and tolerance. Electronics go through burn-in testing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-eng-qa-step">
        <span class="sc-eng-qa-step__num">Stage 02</span>
        <div class="sc-eng-qa-step__name">Assembly Verification</div>
        <p class="sc-eng-qa-step__text">After assembly, each unit undergoes a full functional test: every resistance level, every arm position, every mode. If a single function fails, the unit is pulled and reworked &mdash; not shipped.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-eng-qa-step">
        <span class="sc-eng-qa-step__num">Stage 03</span>
        <div class="sc-eng-qa-step__name">Endurance Simulation</div>
        <p class="sc-eng-qa-step__text">Sample units from each production batch are subjected to accelerated lifecycle testing: thousands of load cycles, temperature variations, and repeated folding and unfolding. This data feeds back into the next production run.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sc-eng-qa-step">
        <span class="sc-eng-qa-step__num">Stage 04</span>
        <div class="sc-eng-qa-step__name">Packaging Engineering</div>
        <p class="sc-eng-qa-step__text">The machine ships in a purpose-designed protective package that has been drop-tested and vibration-tested to survive international shipping without damage.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

